      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "How many years later and we're STILL punishing optimization?\n\nAn avatar with 2 or 3 materials, a few Physbone components, that happens to have 70k polys should NOT be lumped into the same category as the 400k poly, 68 material, 900 bone monstrosities that we default-block VP rank for.\n\nIt's ridiculous how many people will buy an avi base, go to edit it, see \"oh, it's 80k polys base so I'm ALWAYS going to be VeryPoor? Welp, might as well add 7 outfits and a thousand particle effects because I'm going to be categorized the same way anyway!\"\n\nVRC wants us to optimize but causes half of the damn issue by their refusal to fix this ranking system.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
